    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]fgets[/I5]() function shall read bytes from [I6]stream[/I6] into the array pointed to by [I7]s[/I7] until [I8]n[/I8]-1 bytes are\nread, or a &lt;newline&gt; is read and transferred to [I9]s[/I9], or an end-of-file condition is encountered. A null byte shall be\nwritten immediately after the last byte read into the array. If the end-of-file condition is encountered before any bytes are read,\nthe contents of the array pointed to by [I10]s[/I10] shall not be changed.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I7": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I8": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I9": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I10": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     5
    ],
    "text": "[S11][[A12]CX[/A12]][/S11] [IMG13] The\n[I14]fgets[/I14]() function may mark the last data access timestamp of the file associated with [I15]stream[/I15] for update. The last data\naccess timestamp shall be marked for update by the first successful execution of [A16][I17]fgetc[/I17]()[/A16], [I18]fgets[/I18](), [A19][I20]fread[/I20]()[/A19], [A21][I22]fscanf[/I22]()[/A21], [A23][I24]getc[/I24]()[/A23], [A25][I26]getchar[/I26]()[/A25], [A27][I28]getdelim[/I28]()[/A27], [A29][I30]getline[/I30]()[/A29], or [A31][I32]scanf[/I32]()[/A31] using [I33]stream[/I33] that\nreturns data not supplied by a prior call to [A34][I35]ungetc[/I35]()[/A34]. [IMG36]",
    "placeholders": {
     "S11": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
