   {
    "id": "p_00009",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     25,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Upon successful completion, [I38]fgets[/I38]() shall return [I39]s[/I39]. If the stream is at end-of-file, the end-of-file indicator for\nthe stream shall be set and [I40]fgets[/I40]() shall return a null pointer. If an error occurs, the error indicator for the stream\nshall be set, [I41]fgets[/I41]() shall return a null pointer, [S42][[A43]CX[/A43]][/S42] [IMG44] &nbsp;and shall set [I45]errno[/I45] to indicate the error. [IMG46]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I38": {
