   {
    "id": "p_00014",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     37,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The following example uses [I52]fgets[/I52]() to read lines of input. It assumes that the file it is reading is a text file and that\nlines in this text file are no longer than 16384 (or {LINE_MAX} if it is less than 16384 on the implementation where it is running)\nbytes long. (Note that the standard utilities have no line length limit if [I53]sysconf[/I53](_SC_LINE_MAX) returns -1 without setting\n[I54]errno[/I54]. This example assumes that [I55]sysconf[/I55](_SC_LINE_MAX) will not fail.)",
    "placeholders": {
     "I52": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
